{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DZEeU3LJKB9uo5j6yP6HzF","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp-012（准备中）\\\\n- exp-009（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **mvp_003** (success): 同 mvp_002 DGP（c~HalfNormal(1.5), bimodal e, s~N(0,0.8), N=50, J=8, ρ=0.6），MCMC 调优（warmup=2000, samples=4000, chains=4, target_accept=0.95, non-centered parameterization）后收敛达标（R̂<1.05, ESS>100）且 joint 显著优于 sequential。 ← 基于 mvp_002\\\\n- **mvp_002** (negative): 放大 contamination 信号（c~HalfNormal(1.5), bimodal e, s~N(0,0.8), N=50, J=8）后，joint G-MFRM 在 item-level + judge-level confounding (ρ=0.6) 下对 θ_true 的恢复精度显著优于 sequential pipeline。 ← 基于 mvp_001\\\\n- **mvp_001** (negative): 当 d_j 与 c_n·e_i 存在 confounding（item-level + judge-level, ρ>0）时，joint G-MFRM 对 θ_true 的恢复精度（RMSE）显著优于 sequential pipeline，因为 joint estimation 避免了 contamination 效应被 d̂_j 和 b̂_i 吸收。\\\\n  [diagnosis_bias_scatter](rtx6000-4x:/root/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/mvp/diagnosis_bias_scatter.png)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 1 / 负向 2 / 失败 0 / 共 3\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nrtx6000-4x: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1024, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPDfbiLsBEZSQwgbFEbwrb","session_id":"9c40a840-605a-4eab-a479-6b1a1a7ce8af","uuid":"0290bc8d-fabd-4d8e-be93-e6668624f5c0","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:37:34.997Z"}
