{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CrhX9rQyvAuNfsvXenaee7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# gated_mfrm_judge_bias — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-21 21:54 UTC | 更新原因: Dream 审稿报告分析完成，更新 framing/plan/action items\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nG-MFRM 通过 staged joint calibration 统一校正 LLM 评测中的 judge bias 和 contamination。核心 insight: sequential 方法中 judge severity 与 contamination 存在 omitted variable confounding，joint estimation 方法论必要。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 2026-05-21 通过）\\\\n- MVP 验证链: mvp_001→002→003 (PASS: RMSE −43.8%, R̂=1.03, ESS=224)\\\\n- Dream 模拟完成 (dream_20260521T204917): Best=3.5, Median=3.0, Worst=2.5\\\\n- **Dream 分析已完成**: 识别 4 个系统性问题，8 个确认行动项，3 个观察项\\\\n- paper_framing.md 已更新（Claim 2 reframe + Observation 降级 + 新 reviewer concerns）\\\\n- experiment_plan.yaml 已更新（+exp-012 error propagation, 扩展 exp-004/008/009）\\\\n- **需要 re-dream 验证 framing 修改**，达标后批准 P0\\\\n\\\\n## Dream 审稿回溯·系统性问题\\\\n1. **[SYSTEMIC] Presentation quality** (R2-N1, R1-N4, R2-N3, R1-W7): 模板/图表/引用远低于提交标准 → Paper Agent 写作阶段统一解决\\\\n2. **[SYSTEMIC] Claim strength overstated** (R1-N1, R2-W5, R2-W2, R1-N2/R2-W1): \\\\\\\"joint estimation\\\\\\\" 应为 \\\\\\\"staged joint calibration\\\\\\\"; Proposition→Observation → **已修复 paper_framing.md**\\\\n3. **[SYSTEMIC] Model assumptions underdiscussed** (R1-W3, R1-W4, R1-W5, R2-W2): c_n≥0, rank-1, ConStat 依赖 → Limitations 讨论 + exp-007 消融\\\\n4. **[SYSTEMIC] Validation insufficient** (R1-N3, R2-W3, R1-W1): 缺 c_n ground-truth 验证 + rank change + 收敛诊断 → **已加入 exp-009/exp-004/exp-008**\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划摘要（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n| 优先级 | 数量 | GPU·h | 关键实验 |\\\\n|--------|------|-------|---------|\\\\n| P0 | 5 | 200 | 数据收集(130h) + 曝光估计(30h) + G-MFRM 拟合(15h) + Baseline+rank change(20h) + 污染校准(5h) |\\\\n| P1 | 5 | 40 | Judge 数量敏感性 + 指标消融 + Facet 诊断+收敛 + Formal observation + Error propagation |\\\\n| P2 | 2 | 55 | WildBench 复制 + 对抗鲁棒性 |\\\\n| **Total** | **12** | **295** | Critical path: exp-001→002→003→004/005 |\\\\n\\\\n## Dream 观察项（真实实验后评估）\\\\n- [Dream 观察] Δτ 实际意义（exp-003/004 结果出来后判断 Tier A vs Tier B narrative）\\\\n- [Dream 观察] ConStat 在 e_i 估计中的主导性（exp-007 消融后评估）\\\\n- [Dream 观察] Rank-1 misfit 率（exp-008 诊断后评估是否需要 rank-k 讨论）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 启动 re-dream 验证 framing 修改（dream_simulate review_mode=\\\\\\\"full\\\\\\\"）\\\\n- [ ] re-dream 达标后批准 P0 实验\\\\n- [ ] exp-001 + exp-009 + exp-012 可并行启动（exp-009/012 无依赖）\\\\n- [ ] UDA baseline 代码评估（高风险：无公开代码，需 2-4 天重实现）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n4x RTX 6000 96G (rtx6000-4x)，已绑定。\\\\nP0 实验 ~200 GPU·h，4 卡并行 ~50h wall clock (~2 天)。\\\\nProprietary API ~$900。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标会议\\\\n- AAAI 2027: July 28, 2026（~68 天）\\\\n- ACL 2027 ARR: August 3, 2026（~74 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-21 | Dream 审稿分析完成：修正 framing（staged joint → conditional | exp-012, exp-009, exp-004, exp-008 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-21 | MVP PASS，进入 research 阶段 | mvp_003 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-21 | mvp_002 核心效应验证成功（Joint RMSE -32.8%, p=1e-6），收敛未达标， | mvp_001, mvp_002 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-21 | MVP FAIL 但不 kill，启动 DGP 参数诊断 | mvp_001 |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-21 | MVP 采用合成数据恢复实验验证 joint estimation 优势 | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2825, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPDfbiLsBEZSQwgbFEbwrb","session_id":"9c40a840-605a-4eab-a479-6b1a1a7ce8af","uuid":"9b312a48-b296-43b8-9891-6540641a29b2","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:37:59.051Z"}
