/review_report.md\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/review_context.yaml\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/review_report.md\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/logs/review_median.log\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/worst/review_context.yaml\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/_pdf_images/paper_p1.png\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/_pdf_images/paper_p2.png\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/_pdf_images/paper_p3.png\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/_pdf_images/paper_p4.png\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/_pdf_images/paper_p5.png\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T215715/median/_pdf_images/paper_p6.png\n(Results are truncated. Consider using a more specific path or pattern.)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01StVZzDLrKCL5MuGe7BgDik","session_id":"9c40a840-605a-4eab-a479-6b1a1a7ce8af","uuid":"7670ea03-2138-4b98-8a89-ec4422148d51","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:38:01.499Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012borjkXgqaNN7evFzoWmuh","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 6\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 16:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 采用合成数据恢复实验验证 joint estimation 优势\\\\n  rationale: 合成数据 MVP 直接测试核心方法论主张（confounding 导致 sequential 有偏），无需 GPU/API key，实现快速，pass/fail\\\\n    标准明确。若合成数据上 joint 都无法胜出，real data 更不可能。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 18:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP FAIL 但不 kill，启动 DGP 参数诊断\\\\n  rationale: mvp_001 效应方向正确（Joint RMSE < Sequential）但不显著（Δ<0.001, p≈0.37）。Reviewer\\\\n    诊断根因：contamination 信噪比低（c·e≈0.2 vs θ~1.0）、sequential OLS 在高正交变异下意外有效。数学逻辑成立，需找到暴露偏差的参数区间。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: FAIL (p=0.35/0.39, Δ RMSE<0.001)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 19:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: mvp_002 核心效应验证成功（Joint RMSE -32.8%, p=1e-6），收敛未达标，批准 mvp_003 调优 MCMC\\\\n  rationale: mvp_002 证明放大 contamination 后 joint 显著优于 sequential，散点图 r=0.65 直接验证 omitted\\\\n    variable bias 存在。ESS=47<100 是采样器技术问题（posterior geometry 困难），非理论缺陷。mvp_003 通过增加\\\\n    warmup/samples/chains + non-centered parameterization 解决。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_001\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: FAIL (signal too weak)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_002\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: partial PASS (effect strong p=1e-6, convergence FAIL ESS=47)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 20:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS，进入 research 阶段\\\\n  rationale: mvp_003 全面达标：Joint RMSE -43.8% (p=1e-6)，R̂=1.03，ESS=224。散点图 r=0.65 独立验证\\\\n    omitted variable bias。方法在 model misspecification 下仍大幅优于 sequential（DGP 含 s_j，拟合模型不含），提供\\\\n    robustness 证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_003\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: PASS (RMSE -43.8%, p=1e-6, R̂=1.03, ESS=224)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 21:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿分析完成：修正 framing（staged joint → conditional joint, Proposition→Observation），扩展实验计划（+exp-012,\\\\n    扩展 exp-004/008/009），需 re-dream 验证后批准 P0\\\\n  rationale: Dream 三档评分 3.5/3.0/2.5，识别 4 个系统性问题。最关键修正：(1) \\\\\\\"joint estimation\\\\\\\" 过度宣称——e_i\\\\n    在 Stage 2 预固定，改为 \\\\\\\"staged joint calibration\\\\\\\"；(2) Proposition 1 = 标准 OVB，降级为 Observation。新增\\\\n    exp-012 (error propagation sensitivity) 应对 staged estimation 核心质疑。3 个数据依赖观察项（Δτ\\\\n    实际意义、ConStat 主导性、rank-1 misfit）留待真实实验验证。Framing 已修改，需 re-dream 确认提升后才能批准 P0。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: 新增\\\\n    result: Dream R2-W5/R1-N1 驱动\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-009\\\\n    role: 扩展\\\\n    result: 加入 c_n ground-truth 验证，降级 Proposition→Observation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: 扩展\\\\n    result: 加入 rank change analysis\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: 扩展\\\\n    result: 加入 divergent transitions + posterior predictive check\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2593, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPDfbiLsBEZSQwgbFEbwrb","session_id":"9c40a840-605a-4eab-a479-6b1a1a7ce8af","uuid":"6ebd648b-3eff-436d-a7be-9b9a86455d1a","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:37:59.959Z"}
