{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GJmV4KGVhfvN1wPWhz7qXY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01U5FvE2zZpf4M1rjM3kKFkb","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"gated_mfrm_judge_bias","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3952,"cache_read_input_tokens":30188,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3952,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPDfbiLsBEZSQwgbFEbwrb","session_id":"9c40a840-605a-4eab-a479-6b1a1a7ce8af","uuid":"adc63891-fdaa-4339-a9d4-ee7d55baa4cf"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U5FvE2zZpf4M1rjM3kKFkb","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — gated_mfrm_judge_bias\\\\n\\\\n## MVP 验证链 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n### mvp_001: 信号太弱 → FAIL\\\\nc~HalfNormal(0.5), sigmoid(e), N=20, J=5。joint vs sequential Δ=0.0008, p=0.39。contamination 项仅占 logit ~10-15%。\\\\n\\\\n### mvp_002: 方法有效但 MCMC 不收敛 → FAIL (技术性)\\\\nc~HalfNormal(1.5), bimodal e, s~N(0,0.8), N=50, J=8, ρ=0.6。joint RMSE 降 32.8%, p=1e-6。但 ESS=47<100, R̂=1.05 边界。\\\\n\\\\n### mvp_003: MCMC 调优 → **PASS** ✅\\\\n同 mvp_002 DGP + warmup=2000, samples=4000, chains=4, target_accept=0.95, NCP for c。\\\\n- joint RMSE=0.1243±0.016 vs sequential=0.2211±0.038 → **降 43.8%, p=1e-6**\\\\n- joint τ=0.9223±0.010 vs sequential=0.8593±0.029 → +6.3pp\\\\n- R̂=1.03, ESS=224 → 收敛完全达标\\\\n- MCMC 调优不仅修复收敛，还提升了估计精度（mvp_002 joint RMSE=0.1486 → mvp_003=0.1243, -16.4%）\\\\n\\\\n### 散点图确认 omitted variable bias\\\\nmvp_001 ρ=0.6: Pearson r=0.6534 (p≈0)。高 c_n 的 model 被 sequential 系统性高估 θ。\\\\n\\\\n### 关键经验\\\\n- contamination 信号需要足够强（c_scale≥1.5, bimodal e）才能暴露 sequential 的缺陷\\\\n- NCP + target_accept=0.95 对 HalfNormal 约束参数的 MCMC 收敛至关重要\\\\n- 4 chains 比 2 chains 在 ESS 上提升巨大（47→224），不只是线性翻倍\\\\n- JAX CPU 模式下 20 seeds × 4 methods × (2000wu+4000s×4chains) 约 73 min\\\\n\\\\n## ConStat 调研 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n### 基本信息\\\\n- **论文**: \\\\\\\"ConStat: Performance-Based Contamination Detection in LLMs\\\\\\\", NeurIPS 2024 Poster, ETH Zurich SRI Lab\\\\n- **Repo**: github.com/eth-sri/ConStat, Apache-2.0, 低活跃 (4 commits)\\\\n- **核心定义**: Contamination = 不泛化的虚高性能（非单纯训练集包含 benchmark 样本）\\\\n\\\\n### 接口\\\\n`ConStat.test(scores_model, scores_model_ref_data, scores_ref_models, scores_ref_models_ref_data)` → p_value, estimated_contamination, delta, min_delta_095, 置信区间。纯黑盒，不需要 logprobs。\\\\n\\\\n### ⚠️ 对 G-MFRM 的关键 gap\\\\nConStat 输出 **per-model 全局污染检测**，不直接输出 **per-item e_i**。G-MFRM 需要 per-item exposure level。\\\\n- 可利用 `return_functions_test()` 的 spline 拟合函数推导 per-item observed vs expected 偏差作为 e_i proxy\\\\n- 最简方案：直接用 item-level performance gap (original vs reference benchmark) 作为 e_i proxy，ConStat spline hardness correction 作为精确校正层\\\\n\\\\n### 数据需求\\\\n1. Reference benchmark（与原始 benchmark 同分布但未泄露的变体）— **最大依赖**\\\\n2. Reference models（一组已知未污染的模型）的 per-item 评测结果（论文用 ~20 个模型）\\\\n3. 所有数据为 numpy per-item binary scores\\\\n\\\\n### 替代 e_i 估计方案\\\\n| 方法 | per-item? | 需要 logprobs? |\\\\n|------|-----------|---------------|\\\\n| ConStat spline 推导 | 间接可得 | 否 |\\\\n| Performance gap (orig vs ref) | 是 | 否 |\\\\n| LogProber | 天然 per-item | 是（无官方 repo） |\\\\n| Min-K% Prob | 天然 per-item | 是 |\\\\n\\\\n## Baseline 代码可用性 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n| Baseline | 代码 | License | 重实现难度 |\\\\n|----------|------|---------|-----------|\\\\n| CyclicJudge | 无 repo | — | 低 (~100行) |\\\\n| UDA | 无（anonymous 403） | — | 中 (2-4天) |\\\\n| DCR | github.com/chengxuphd/dcr | Apache-2.0 | 适配即可 |\\\\n| Preference Leakage | github.com/David-Li0406/Preference-Leakage | 无 license, 82% notebooks | 需整理 |\\\\n\\\\n### 下一步\\\\nMVP 通过后应：写 paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml → 进入 research 阶段（真实数据实验）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2712, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPDfbiLsBEZSQwgbFEbwrb","session_id":"9c40a840-605a-4eab-a479-6b1a1a7ce8af","uuid":"445d815b-5688-4436-b85c-abb4ff0c01ce","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:38:02.869Z"}
